OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CParents live in fear paedophile        
OL,5,Cnursery worker harmed their children   
OL,6,GParents are calling for mandatory CCTV 
OL,7,Gin nurseries after a worker who looked 
OL,8,Gafter their children was later exposed 
OL,9,Gas a paedophile.                       
OL,11,FNathan Bennett was jailed in February  
OL,12,Ffor multiple counts of sexual abuse,   
OL,13,Fincluding two counts of rape, against  
OL,14,Ffive boys at Partou King Street        
OL,15,Fnursery in Bristol. His crimes were    
OL,16,Fdiscovered after a CCTV review.        
OL,18,FBennett previously worked as an        
OL,19,Fapprentice for 18 months at another    
OL,20,Fnursery in the Somerset area - which   
OL,21,Fthe BBC is not naming ` which does not 
OL,22,Fhave CCTV.                        G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
