OL,4,CFour headline acts announced for       
OL,5,CBoardmasters                           
OL,6,GBoardmasters has announced its         
OL,7,Gheadline acts and, for the first time, 
OL,8,Gone will play on the Thursday night of 
OL,9,Gthe Cornwall festival.                 
OL,11,FThe festival at Watergate Bay,         
OL,12,FNewquay, is set to run from 4 - 8      
OL,13,FAugust, with Dutch DJ Chris Stassy     
OL,14,Fheadlining on Thursday, Chase & Status 
OL,15,Fon Friday, Disclosure on Saturday      
OL,16,Fnight and Wolf Alice on Sunday night.  
OL,18,FIt will be the first time the main     
OL,19,Fstage hosts live music on a Thursday,  
OL,20,Fwith Chris Stassy headlining in        
OL,21,Fpartnership with BBC Radio 1 Dance.    
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
