OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CVillages get share of #50m flood       
OL,5,Cdefence fund                           
OL,6,GA trio of villages have secured a      
OL,7,Gshare of #50m from central government  
OL,8,Gto help combat flooding.               
OL,10,FThe Three Villages Flood Group (3VFG), 
OL,11,Fwhich covers Ashington, Chilton        
OL,12,FCantelo and Mudford near Yeovil in     
OL,13,FSomerset, said it is one of the groups 
OL,14,Fbenefitting from #10m of the funding.  
OL,16,FThe Department for the Environment,    
OL,17,FFood and Rural Affairs (Defra)         
OL,18,Fprovided funding in early-June for     
OL,19,F"flood resilience" projects in the     
OL,20,Faftermath of Storm Chandra, which      
OL,21,Fcaused significant disruption across   
OL,22,FSomerset throughout the winter.   G4/4 
